cartridge "TREASURE DIVER/OCEAN EXPEDITION/2026"
' TREASURE DIVER: OCEAN EXPEDITION
' An artistic ChatGPT reinterpretation inspired by Brian Casey's
' Treasure Diver, published in COMPUTE!'s Gazette, May 1988.
' Its presentation and mechanics deliberately differ from the original.
' Move in 8 directions. Fire = rechargeable 2x escape boost.
' Collect chest at seabed, return to surface for air. Avoid sharks.
const DiverSpr = 0
const ChestSpr = 1
const FirstShark = 2
const LastShark = 6
const SndMusic = 1
const SndSwim = 2
const SndBass = 6
const SndTreasure = 3
const SndBite = 4
const SndOver = 5
