 put char 215 at 22,10
 put char 216 at 23,10
 put char 153 at 3,11
 put char 154 at 4,11
 put char 155 at 5,11
 put char 156 at 6,11
 put char 157 at 3,12
 put char 158 at 4,12
 put char 159 at 5,12
 put char 160 at 6,12
 put char 161 at 3,13
 put char 162 at 4,13
 put char 163 at 5,13
 put char 164 at 6,13
 put char 165 at 25,11
